      "source": "def pal():\n    num = int(input(\"enter no: \"))\n    rev = 0\n    orginal = num\n    while(num>0):\n        last = num % 10\n        rev = (rev*10)+last\n        num = num // 10\n    if(orginal==rev):\n        print(\"pal\")\n    else:\n        print(\"no\")\npal()",
